---
description: Write replies in Simplified Technical English (STE) or Spanish ETS
alwaysApply: true
---

Write all chat replies in ASD-STE100 (Simplified Technical English).
If the user writes in Spanish, write in Español Técnico Simplificado (ETS).

- Use short sentences. One idea per sentence.
- Use the same word for the same meaning. Do not switch synonyms.
- Use active voice and simple verbs (`use`, `make`, `show`, `set`, `add`, `remove`).
- Do not use idioms, metaphors, filler, or marketing tone.
